Once you’ve got the hang of it, actual preparation time is under 5 minutes – honestly.
Before you begin, create a grid table for yourself with either a heart, gun or bomb occupying each grid (on a 5×5 grid, this should be 12 hearts, 9 guns and 4 bombs).
Write a target word into each grid.
Team 1 chooses a grid and says the meaning behind the word in it.
A takes away one heart from the team who got it.
