On November 10, 2020, the local fire and rescue brigade in Anshan city, Liaoning Province, was informed that an explosion occurred at a factory in the south of The Ertaizi Traffic Gang. The situation on the site was very critical, posing a great threat to the normal life and life safety of the surrounding residents.After firefighters arrived, they quickly investigated the scene and analyzed the cause of the explosion.
According to witnesses, there were three loud and extremely loud bangs from the factory, the sound of which could be clearly heard several kilometers away and a huge mushroom cloud rose into the sky.A large number of firefighters rushed to the scene to deal with the accident, but the details of the explosion and casualties are still unknown, subject to a final police report.
